At Bharat Forge, our Total Rewards Philosophy is a cornerstone of our corporate governance framework, integrating our business and people strategies with a commitment to fair, competitive, and tailored remuneration. We ensure our rewards practices remain aligned with external market benchmarks and internal equity while complying with regulations and balancing employer affordability with employee expectations. Our holistic approach extends beyond salary increments to include career advancement opportunities, global mobility initiatives, higher education support, and a robust recognition programme that celebrates top performers. Underpinning these efforts is our dedication to the three Cs — Competitiveness, Contextualisation, and Cause — ensuring that every reward is not only market-competitive but also personalised and aligned with the broader values and aspirations of our workforce.
